z.out <- zelig(form = yr.rnd ~ api00, data = apistrat, model =
'logit.survey', id = ~1, strata = ~ stype, weight = ~pw, fpc = ~fpc)

Respectfully,

Frank Lawrence

From frl2-8DAjSxpRXgY at public.gmane.org  Wed Dec  2 18:15:30 2009
