lines could be added to a plot by

lines(x,y)

where x is a vector of x coordinates and y is a vector of y coordinates. 
Here is an example from the manual, which can be run by example(plot.ci)

> lines(age.range, apply(s.out$qi$fd, 2, mean))
> lines(age.range, apply(s.out$qi$fd+s.out$qi$ev, 2, mean))

In your case, x would be chos.range rather than age.range

