Dear Yiannis,

To add a line (or more than one line) to the plot, you just do a
lines() statement after the plot.ci() statement.  Off the top of my
head (e.g., you should check this),  it's something like:

plot.ci(  [...your code here...])
y <- apply(s.out$qi$ev, 2, mean)
lines(chos.range, y, ...)  # Add additional options like col and lty here
y1 <- apply((s.out$qi$ev + s.out$qi$fd), 2, mean)
lines(chos.range, y1, ...)

HTH,
Olivia

