> 0.2070 0.2300 0.2173 0.2275 0.2145

Standard deviation between these means is 0.009487518 - something
rather small. In the lme4 run you got estimate for the residual SD of
0.0311, which indicates that between group variation is much smaller
than within the groups. As the joint posterior of variances is surely
quite skewed for the between group variance side (due to small number
of groups) it is possible that the REML estimate of the mode is zero.

